sequenceDiagram
    CO->>Env: Mutate Environmental CPPN
    CO->>Agents: Evaluate in new world (Transfer test)
    alt Energy < -5.0 OR Var < 0.001
        CO->>Env: Reject Substrate (Goldilocks Filter)
    else Viable Substrate
        CO->>Agents: Rank all agents (PATA-EC)
        Note over CO: Compute Spearman Rank Correlation (r)
        alt r > 0.9 (Redundant)
            CO->>Env: Reject Substrate (Universally easier/harder)
        else r <= 0.9 (Novel)
            CO->>Env: Add Substrate to Niche Pool
        end
    end